*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Minimal hand-written PPD for testing colour with the cups driver and the CUPS rastertohp
*% filter: DeskJet-style ColorModel choices (gray, CMY and KCMY, banded, 1 bit per colour).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "COLORDJ.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(Generic Colour Inkjet)"
*ModelName: "Generic Colour Inkjet"
*ShortNickName: "Generic Colour Inkjet"
*NickName: "Generic Colour Inkjet, test PPD"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 50 rastertohp"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Page Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "18 36 594 756"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 36 577 806"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: CMYK
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 3/cupsCompression 2>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorOrder 1/cupsColorSpace 4/cupsCompression 2>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel CMYK/CMYK: "<</cupsColorOrder 1/cupsColorSpace 8/cupsCompression 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 150dpi/150 DPI: "<</HWResolution[150 150]/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]/cupsBitsPerColor 1>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*% End of color-deskjet.ppd
